# Engine

- Every model call goes through `openrouter_client.py` with data collection denied. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- No model call inside an HTTP request. Long work is a job with a job row and the page polls. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- Kill switches fail closed. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- Holds and approvals are separate record types. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- Spend is recorded on `USAGE#<date>` rows and checked before each call. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- Schedules are EventBridge Scheduler with an IAM-role target and an explicit time zone. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- A model never produces a number that sizes or prices an order. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- Formulas and thresholds come from `contracts/methodology.json`. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- The broker host is the paper host unless `BROKER_MODE` is `live`. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- No file over 500 lines. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
